{"page":324,"verses":[{"verse_key":"21:25","surah":21,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَرْسَلْنَا مِن قَبْلِكَ مِن رَّسُولٍ إِلَّا نُوحِىٓ إِلَيْهِ أَنَّهُۥ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّآ أَنَا۠ فَٱعْبُدُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We never sent any messenger before you [Muhammad] without revealing to him: ‘There is no god but Me, so serve Me.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَّسُولٍ","en_gloss":"Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlin","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُوحِىٓ","en_gloss":"We reveal(ed)","transliteration":"nūḥī","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"that [He]","transliteration":"annahu","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(There is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَنَا۠","en_gloss":"Me","transliteration":"anā","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَٱعْبُدُونِ","en_gloss":"so worship Me","transliteration":"fa-uʿ'budūni","verse_key":"21:25"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:25"}]},{"verse_key":"21:26","surah":21,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ ٱتَّخَذَ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ وَلَدًا ۗ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۚ بَلْ عِبَادٌ مُّكْرَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And they say, ‘The Lord of Mercy has taken offspring for Himself.’ May He be exalted! No! They are only His honoured servants:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذَ","en_gloss":"Has taken","transliteration":"ittakhadha","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Most Gracious","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَدًۭا ۗ","en_gloss":"a son","transliteration":"waladan","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"Glorified is He","transliteration":"sub'ḥānahu","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عِبَادٌۭ","en_gloss":"(they are) slaves","transliteration":"ʿibādun","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُّكْرَمُونَ","en_gloss":"honored","transliteration":"muk'ramūna","verse_key":"21:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:26"}]},{"verse_key":"21:27","surah":21,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يَسْبِقُونَهُۥ بِٱلْقَوْلِ وَهُم بِأَمْرِهِۦ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they do not speak before He speaks and they act by His command.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْبِقُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"they (can) precede Him","transliteration":"yasbiqūnahu","verse_key":"21:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْقَوْلِ","en_gloss":"in word","transliteration":"bil-qawli","verse_key":"21:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهُم","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"21:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ","en_gloss":"by His command","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","verse_key":"21:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"act","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"21:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:27"}]},{"verse_key":"21:28","surah":21,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَهُمْ وَلَا يَشْفَعُونَ إِلَّا لِمَنِ ٱرْتَضَىٰ وَهُم مِّنْ خَشْيَتِهِۦ مُشْفِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He knows what is before them and what is behind them, and they cannot intercede without His permission––indeed they themselves stand in awe of Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"He knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(is) before them","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"(is) before them","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلْفَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) behind them","transliteration":"khalfahum","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَشْفَعُونَ","en_gloss":"they (can) intercede","transliteration":"yashfaʿūna","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِمَنِ","en_gloss":"for whom","transliteration":"limani","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱرْتَضَىٰ","en_gloss":"He approves","transliteration":"ir'taḍā","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَهُم","en_gloss":"And they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَشْيَتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"fear of Him","transliteration":"khashyatihi","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُشْفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"stand in awe","transliteration":"mush'fiqūna","verse_key":"21:28"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:28"}]},{"verse_key":"21:29","surah":21,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَمَن يَقُلْ مِنْهُمْ إِنِّىٓ إِلَـٰهٌ مِّن دُونِهِۦ فَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِيهِ جَهَنَّمَ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِى ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If any of them were to claim, ‘I am a god beside Him,’ We would reward them with Hell: this is how We reward evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَقُلْ","en_gloss":"says","transliteration":"yaqul","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I am","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","en_gloss":"a god","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Then that","transliteration":"fadhālika","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَجْزِيهِ","en_gloss":"We will recompense","transliteration":"najzīhi","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(with) Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَجْزِى","en_gloss":"We recompense","transliteration":"najzī","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"21:29"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٩","en_gloss":"(29)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:29"}]},{"verse_key":"21:30","surah":21,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ كَانَتَا رَتْقًا فَفَتَقْنَـٰهُمَا ۖ وَجَعَلْنَا مِنَ ٱلْمَآءِ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ حَىٍّ ۖ أَفَلَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Are the disbelievers not aware that the heavens and the earth used to be joined together and that We ripped them apart, that We made every living thing from water? Will they not believe?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَ","en_gloss":"see","transliteration":"yara","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانَتَا","en_gloss":"were","transliteration":"kānatā","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَتْقًۭا","en_gloss":"a joined entity","transliteration":"ratqan","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَفَتَقْنَـٰهُمَا ۖ","en_gloss":"then We parted them","transliteration":"fafataqnāhumā","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمَآءِ","en_gloss":"[the] water","transliteration":"l-māi","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"living thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":16,"ar":"حَىٍّ ۖ","en_gloss":"living thing","transliteration":"ḥayyin","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَفَلَا","en_gloss":"Then will not","transliteration":"afalā","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"they believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"21:30"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:30"}]},{"verse_key":"21:31","surah":21,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ رَوَٰسِىَ أَن تَمِيدَ بِهِمْ وَجَعَلْنَا فِيهَا فِجَاجًا سُبُلًا لَّعَلَّهُمْ يَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And We put firm mountains on the earth, lest it should sway under them, and set broad paths on it, so that they might follow the right direction,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We (have) placed","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَوَٰسِىَ","en_gloss":"firmly set mountains","transliteration":"rawāsiya","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَمِيدَ","en_gloss":"it (should) shake","transliteration":"tamīda","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِمْ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِجَاجًۭا","en_gloss":"broad passes","transliteration":"fijājan","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سُبُلًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) ways","transliteration":"subulan","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَهْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"(be) guided","transliteration":"yahtadūna","verse_key":"21:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:31"}]},{"verse_key":"21:32","surah":21,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلسَّمَآءَ سَقْفًا مَّحْفُوظًا ۖ وَهُمْ عَنْ ءَايَـٰتِهَا مُعْرِضُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and We made the sky a well-secured canopy- yet from its wonders they turn away.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"21:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","en_gloss":"the sky","trans