","transliteration":"yasbaḥūna","verse_key":"21:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:33"}]},{"verse_key":"21:34","surah":21,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا جَعَلْنَا لِبَشَرٍ مِّن قَبْلِكَ ٱلْخُلْدَ ۖ أَفَإِي۟ن مِّتَّ فَهُمُ ٱلْخَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have not granted everlasting life to any other human being before you either [Muhammad]- if you die, will [the disbelievers] live for ever?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِبَشَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"for any man","transliteration":"libasharin","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْخُلْدَ ۖ","en_gloss":"[the] immortality","transliteration":"l-khul'da","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَفَإِي۟ن","en_gloss":"so if","transliteration":"afa-in","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّتَّ","en_gloss":"you die","transliteration":"mitta","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَهُمُ","en_gloss":"then (would) they","transliteration":"fahumu","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْخَـٰلِدُونَ","en_gloss":"live forever","transliteration":"l-khālidūna","verse_key":"21:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:34"}]},{"verse_key":"21:35","surah":21,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ذَآئِقَةُ ٱلْمَوْتِ ۗ وَنَبْلُوكُم بِٱلشَّرِّ وَٱلْخَيْرِ فِتْنَةً ۖ وَإِلَيْنَا تُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Every soul is certain to taste death: We test you all through the bad and the good, and to Us you will all return.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"Every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"21:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafs